&P370426 = CT 08, pl. 02, Bu 1891-05-09, 0747 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. _1(u) 6(disz) ma-na ku3-babbar_ 
#tr.ts: šeššeret manā kaspum
#tr.en: 16 minas of silver

2. sza isz-tu _iti bara2-za3-gar mu {d}nin-urta am! sag# [...]_ 
#tr.ts: ša ištu waraḫ nišānim šanat ana ninurta rīmim rēštîm ...
#tr.en: that from the month of Nišānum (of) the year 31 of Ammi-ditana (lit. the year: "(For) Ninurta the foremost wild bull ...")

3. a-di _iti szu-numun-a mu alan_ sa-am-su-i-lu-na lugal [...] 
#tr.ts: adi waraḫ dumuzim šanat ṣalam samsu-iluna šarrim ...
#tr.en: to the month of Dumuzi (of) the year 34 of Ammi-ditana (lit. the year: "A statue of Samsu-iluna the king ...") 

4. i-na su2-ud-du-ri-im id-di-nu 
#tr.ts: ina suddurim iddinū
#tr.en: have been paid in installments (and)

5. sza {d}suen-im-gur-an-ni _dumu-e2-dub-ba-a_ im-tah-ha-ru 
#tr.ts: ša sîn-imguranni mār bīt ṭuppi imtaḫḫaru
#tr.en: that Sîn-imguranni the military scribe has received;

$ single ruling 
6. _2(disz) ma-na sza3 sa10 amar mu 3(asz)_ 
#tr.ts: šinā manā libbu šīm būrim ša šālaš šanātim
#tr.en: 2 minas (of silver), part of the price of the three-years-old calf

7. sza i-na _e2-gal_ a-na _dam-gar3-mesz_ in-na-ad-nu 
#tr.ts: ša ina ekallim ana tamkārī innadnū
#tr.en: that has been given to the merchants at the palace (and that)

8. it-ti _dam-gar3-mesz sipa-mesz_ i-sza-mu 
#tr.ts: itti tamkārī rē’ū išāmū
#tr.en: the shepherds purchased from the merchants,

9. _ku3-babbar_ i-na qa2-ti _sipa_ it-ta-ad-di-nu-ma 
#tr.ts: kaspam ina qāti rē’îm ittaddinūma
#tr.en: (the merchants) every time have handed over the silver (received) from shepherds’ hands and

10. a-na _nig2-ka9_ isz-ta!-ak#-ka#-nu# 
#tr.ts: ana nikkassim ištakkanū
#tr.en: have deposited into the account;

$ single ruling 
11. _1(u) 8(disz) ma-na# [ku3-babbar_] 
#tr.ts: šamāššeret manā kaspum
#tr.en: (total:) 18 minas of silver,

12. sza# [i]-na# _1(disz) [ma-na-e_ ... ma-ah-ru] 
#tr.ts: ša ina ištēn manā ... maḫru
#tr.en: of which have been received ... per mina,

13. sza a-na _{gi}pisan lugal#_ [ik-kam-su2-ma] 
#tr.ts: ša ana pisan šarrim ikkamsūma
#tr.en: that have been collected for the royal coffer(s) but,

14. a-di-ni ka-ni-ik _e2-gal_ la [ik-ka-an-na-ku] 
#tr.ts: adīni kanīk ekallim la ikkannakū
#tr.en: so far, had not yet been provided a sealed document of the palace.

@reverse 
1. _sza3 ku3-babbar sa10 siki amar mu 3(asz) u3# [sze-gesz-i3_] 
#tr.ts: libbu kaspim šīm šipātim būrim ša šālaš šanātim u šamaššammī
#tr.en: (The 18 minas are:) part of the silver, price of the wool, the three-years-old calf and the sesame,

2. sza i-na _e2-gal_ im-tah-ha-ru 
#tr.ts: ša ina ekallim imtaḫḫaru
#tr.en: that (Utu-šumundib) has received at the palace;

3. szi-ta-at sza _mu {d}urasz ur-sag gal-la-asz_ 
#tr.ts: šītat ša šanat ana uraš uršānim rabîm
#tr.en: the rest of (the sale in) the year 27 of Ammi-ditana (lit. the year: "For Uraš the great hero")

4. u3 _sza3_ sza _mu alan-a-ni masz2-da-ri-a_ 
#tr.ts: u libbu ša šanat ṣalamšu mašdaria
#tr.en: and part of (the sale in) the year 28 of Ammi-ditana (lit. the year: "His statue (bearing) the mašdaria levy")

5. sza qa2-ti-szu 
#tr.ts: ša qātīšu
#tr.en: which are under his responsability (lit. in his hands).

6. _mu-kux(DU)_ {d}utu-szu-mu-un-dib _di-ku5 dumu_ dingir-szu-ib-ni 
#tr.ts: šūrubti utu-šumundib dayyānim mār ilšu-ibni
#tr.en: Contribution of Utu-šumundib the judge son of Ilšu-ibni

7. u3 e-t,i-rum _dumu_ sa3-ni-iq-pi4-{d}utu 
#tr.ts: u eṭirum mār saniq-pî-šamaš
#tr.en: and Eṭirum son of Saniq-pî-šamaš

8. _sza3 kar_ zimbir{ki}-ia-ah-ru-rum 
#tr.ts: libbu kār sippir-yaḫrurum
#tr.en: member of the kārum body of Sippar-yaḫrurum.

$ single ruling 
9. ka-ni-ku sza isz-tu _iti bara2-za3-gar_ 
#tr.ts: kanīkū ša ištu waraḫ nišānim
#tr.en: The sealed documents (related to the period) from the month of Nišānum

10. _mu {d}nin-urta am sag a2-dah-a-ni-sze3_ 
#tr.ts: šanat ana ninurta rīmim rēštîm rēṣīšu
#tr.en: of the year 31 of Ammi-ditana (lit. the year: "For Ninurta the foremost wild bull, his helper")

11. a-di _iti szu-numun-a mu alan_ sa-am-su-[i-lu-na] _pa4-bil-ga-ni_ 
#tr.ts: adi waraḫ dumuzi šanat ṣalam samsu-iluna abi abīšu
#tr.en: to the month of Dumuzi of the year 34 of Ammi-ditana (lit. the year: "A statue of Samsu-iluna the king, his father's father"),

12. i-na _{gi}pisan_ {d}utu-szu-mu-un-dib szar-ru-x x kam 
#tr.ts: ina pisan utu-mundib ...
#tr.en: from the (tablets) container of Utu-šumundib ...

$ single ruling 
13. _iti szu-numun-a u4 2(u)# [n-kam_] 
#tr.ts: waraḫ dumuzi ūmam ešrā u ...
#tr.en: The month of Dumuzi, the day 20 + n (?)

14. _mu_ am-mi-di-ta-na _lugal-e alan_ sa-am-su-i-lu-na _pa4-bil-<ga>-ni e2-nam-ti-la-sze3_ 
#tr.ts: šattum ša ammi-ditana šarrum ṣalam samsu-iluna abi abīšu ana enamtila
#tr.en: the year in which Ammi-ditana the king (brought) a statue of Samsu-iluna his grandfather into Enamtila.

